---
// EthicsIncidents: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="ein">
  <div class="ein-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Timeline from 2005 to 2025 with three bars: the Dutch tax fraud-scoring system 2005 to 2019, the Amazon recruiting model 2014 to 2017, and the GM and OnStar data sharing 2024 to 2025.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Three systems, three stretches of harm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ba hệ thống, ba quãng thời gian gây hại</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Each bar is the period the system was running, taken from the cases in this post.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi thanh là quãng thời gian hệ thống chạy, lấy từ các ca trong bài này.</tspan></text>
      <line x1="325" y1="64" x2="325" y2="292" class="grid" />
      <text x="325" y="312" class="muted" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2005</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2005</tspan></text>
      <line x1="453" y1="64" x2="453" y2="292" class="grid" />
      <text x="453" y="312" class="muted" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2010</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2010</tspan></text>
      <line x1="580" y1="64" x2="580" y2="292" class="grid" />
      <text x="580" y="312" class="muted" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2015</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2015</tspan></text>
      <line x1="707" y1="64" x2="707" y2="292" class="grid" />
      <text x="707" y="312" class="muted" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2020</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2020</tspan></text>
      <line x1="835" y1="64" x2="835" y2="292" class="grid" />
      <text x="835" y="312" class="muted" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2025</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2025</tspan></text>
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={38} y={92} size={28} />
      <text x="64" y="88" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Dutch tax authority</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cơ quan Thuế Hà Lan</tspan></text>
      <text x="64" y="106" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>Fraud score flagged dual</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điểm gian lận đánh dấu song tịch</tspan></text>
      <text x="64" y="122" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>nationality in childcare claims</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong hồ sơ trợ cấp trẻ em</tspan></text>
      <rect x="325" y="92" width="357" height="16" rx="4" class="bar" />
      <text x="325" y="86" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>2005–2019</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2005–2019</tspan></text>
      <text x="692" y="105" class="redtxt"><tspan data-lang-en>Cabinet resigned in 2021</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nội các từ chức năm 2021</tspan></text>
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={38} y={172} size={28} />
      <text x="64" y="168" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Amazon recruiting model</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Công cụ lọc CV của Amazon</tspan></text>
      <text x="64" y="186" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>Penalized resumes with</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trừ điểm CV có chữ</tspan></text>
      <text x="64" y="202" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>"women's" in them</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>"women's"</tspan></text>
      <rect x="555" y="172" width="76" height="16" rx="4" class="bar" />
      <text x="555" y="166" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>2014–2017</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2014–2017</tspan></text>
      <text x="641" y="185" class="redtxt"><tspan data-lang-en>Tool scrapped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dự án bị bỏ</tspan></text>
      <DiagramIcon name="car" x={38} y={252} size={28} />
      <text x="64" y="248" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>GM and OnStar</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GM và OnStar</tspan></text>
      <text x="64" y="266" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>Driving data reached insurers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dữ liệu lái xe tới hãng bảo hiểm</tspan></text>
      <text x="64" y="282" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>through reporting agencies</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>qua công ty báo cáo</tspan></text>
      <rect x="809" y="252" width="26" height="16" rx="4" class="bar" />
      <text x="809" y="246" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>2024–2025</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2024–2025</tspan></text>
      <text x="799" y="265" class="redtxt" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>FTC proposed a 5-year ban, Jan 2025</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>FTC đề xuất cấm 5 năm, 1/2025</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Harm ran for years before anyone stopped it: about 14 years for the Dutch system, about 3 for the Amazon model. Dates and outcomes are from the cases in this post.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tác hại kéo dài nhiều năm trước khi có ai dừng lại: khoảng 14 năm với hệ thống Hà Lan, khoảng 3 năm với mô hình của Amazon. Mốc thời gian và hệ quả lấy từ các ca trong bài.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ein { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ein-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ein svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ein text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ein .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ein .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ein .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ein .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ein .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ein .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ein .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ein .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ein .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ein .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ein .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ein .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ein .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ein .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .ein .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ein .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ein .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ein .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ein .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ein .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .ein .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ein .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .ein .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ein figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
